<title>ESTONIA: RAKVERE TO MAKE NO DIVIDEND PAYMENTS.</title>
<headline>RAKVERE TO MAKE NO DIVIDEND PAYMENTS.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rakvere general shareholders meeting decided not to distribute its 1996 profit and pay no dividends, the company said on Friday.</p>
<p>In a statement, the company said shareholders voted against distributing the profits as it approved the financial results for 1996.</p>
<p>-- David Mardiste, Tallinn newsroom +372 620 9202/1 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
